UPDATE companies SET description='Pro Shaper Sheet Metal LLC operates from Charlton, Massachusetts.

The shop provides TIG, MIG, and specialty welding across steel, stainless steel, and aluminum, alongside full metal fabrication ranging from repair work to custom one-off panels. Core processes include wheeling, planishing, shrinking, stretching, and panel development for coachbuilding and structural shaping. Pro Shaper also designs and sells professional-grade shaping tools — such as shrinking discs, mallet sets, and lead-shot dollies — and runs small-group hands-on classes covering fundamentals through advanced surfacing techniques.

Customers span classic-car restorers, concept-car developers, and fabricators seeking to refine their panel-beating skills. Training and tooling are aimed at serious fabricators who want repeatable results at their own benches.

Pro Shaper positions itself on the principle that "control, patience, and the right tool — that is how great shapes happen." The firm differentiates by combining old-world coachbuilding discipline with contemporary tooling and instruction, building and sourcing tools that earn their place on the bench and teaching customers to maximize each pass.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["TIG welding", "MIG welding", "Specialty welding", "Metal shaping", "Wheeling", "Planishing", "Shrinking", "Stretching", "Panel development", "Coachbuilding", "Coachwork", "Structural metal shaping", "Bespoke panel fabrication", "Custom fabrication", "Repair fabrication", "Metal shaping instruction", "Tool retail", "Tooling support"], "industries": ["Classic car restoration", "Collector car restoration", "Automotive concept development", "Metal fabrication", "Coachbuilding", "Metal shaping education"], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["Shrinking Disc Super Combo", "Advanced Metal Shaping Kit", "Metal Shaping Mallet Set with Delrin Heads", "Soft Body Dolly Filled with #9 Lead Shot"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Bridges old-world coachbuilding discipline with modern fabrication demands", "Builds and sources professional-grade metal shaping tools", "Offers hands-on classes in wheeling, planishing, shrinking/stretching, and panel development", "Delivers coachbuilt panels with period correctness and modern durability", "Curates tooling and accessories backed by daily shop use"], "facts_used": ["Location: Charlton, Massachusetts -> db", "Founder Wray and family history (grandfather Ted Billings, 1960 restoration business) -> /about", "Processes: TIG, MIG, specialty welding; metal shaping (wheeling, planishing, shrinking, stretching, panel development); coachbuilding; custom fabrication -> / and description", "Tool products: Shrinking Disc Super Combo, Advanced Metal Shaping Kit, Metal Shaping Mallet 