UPDATE companies SET description='Provisur Technologies is headquartered in Mokena, Illinois. The company operates as a global manufacturer of food processing equipment, though its founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

Provisur designs and builds equipment under several established brands, including Weiler mixer grinders, Formax forming systems, Beehive separators, and Lutetia defrosting tumblers. Its portfolio covers grinding, forming, slicing, mechanical separation, defrosting, marinating, cooking, pasteurizing, and chilling. The company employs approximately 3,000 people worldwide and maintains two Ingenuity Centers where customers can test new technologies and processes.

Typical applications include ground and formed products such as burgers, chicken nuggets, meatballs, and fish sticks; sliced products including bacon; mechanically separated proteins; whole-muscle and bone-in items; and automated cooking, pasteurizing, and chilling lines.

