UPDATE companies SET description='Q Cells USA, headquartered in Placentia, California, was founded in 1999. The company operates as a solar panel manufacturer and energy solutions provider with a stated commitment to American manufacturing, including a PV solar cell production facility in Cartersville, Georgia.

