UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Foods Distributing is based in Bozeman, Montana. It was founded by Randy and Nancy Lindberg. Randy’s family had acquired a natural products distributor called Nature’s Best in the late 1960s, and he grew that business into the largest privately owned wholesaler‑distributor in the natural products industry. After leaving that company in 2005 and serving as Western Region President for United Natural Foods, Inc., the Lindbergs moved to Bozeman and launched Quality Foods Distributing to provide reliable logistics and distribution for natural, organic, and local foods across Montana and the Northern Rockies.

The company operates as a wholesale distributor, sourcing natural, organic, specialty, and regionally produced foods from local farmers, ranchers, and brands. It manages warehousing, order fulfillment, and delivery logistics for a range of customers, offering on‑time delivery, sales support, and supplier partnership development.

Quality Foods Distributing serves grocery stores, restaurants and coffee shops, universities and hospitals, hotels, lodges, and national parks throughout Montana and the Northern Rockies. Its customer base includes both independent retailers and institutional foodservice operations.

