UPDATE companies SET description='R & B Steel Fabrications has operated from Rockville, Maryland since 1976, serving the DMV (District of Columbia, Maryland, Virginia) region with snow removal equipment and related services. The company was established as a distributor and service provider for snow removal equipment brands.

