UPDATE companies SET description='R&E Tooling & Plastics, Inc. has operated from Haltom City, Texas, since 1970. The company was founded over five decades ago and today draws on a combined 125 years of staff experience in plastic injection molding. No founder names or ownership designations are disclosed in public materials.

