UPDATE companies SET description='RACE Metalsmiths operates from White River Junction, Vermont. Founded in 1997, the company is family-owned and operated, serving the Upper Connecticut River Valley of Vermont and New Hampshire.

The shop runs a full-service machine shop offering milling, drilling, turning, threading, thread repair, flywheel grinding, small engine boring and honing, cylinder head and manifold resurfacing, driveshaft building, rebuilding and repair, custom metal fabrication, welding (MIG, TIG, and gas), powder coating, media blasting (sandblasting and glass bead), CNC machining, metal prototyping, and metal design and engineering. A small, knowledgeable staff handles jobs ranging from single prototypes to production runs for larger companies.

Customers span automotive, motorcycle, heavy equipment, antique and classic vehicle restoration, powersports (including snowmobiles, bicycles, and hot rods), architectural metalwork such as railings and brackets, artistic pieces like statues, and outdoor furniture. The client base includes individual inventors developing prototypes as well as established firms placing production orders.

The company emphasizes its reputation for handling difficult-to-powder-coat materials and demanding tolerances, positioning itself as the custom powder coat shop in the Northeast. Projects finished at RACE Metalsmiths have won awards at car and bike shows across the United States, reflecting a focus on quality craftsmanship at competitive costs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Milling", "Drilling", "Turning", "Threading", "Thread repair", "Flywheel grinding", "Small engine boring", "Honing", "Cylinder head resurfacing", "Manifold resurfacing", "Driveshaft building", "Driveshaft rebuilding", "Driveshaft repair", "Powder coating", "Media blasting (sandblasting, glass bead)", "Custom metal fabrication", "Welding (MIG, TIG, gas)", "CNC machining", "Metal prototyping", "Metal design and engineering", "Broken bolt removal"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Motorcycle", "Heavy equipment", "Antique and classic vehicle restoration", "Powersports", "Architectural metalwork", "Art and sculpture", "Outdoor furniture"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Cast iron", "Mild steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated since 1997", "Specializes in difficult-to-powder-coat materials and demanding tolerances", "Leading custom powder coat shop in the Northeast", "Serves prototype through production runs", "Offers design, engineering, and fabrication of precision tools and fixtures"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1997 -> db", "Founded in 1997 -> /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /about-us", "Headquarters: White River Junction, VT -> / (address)", "Services: milling, drilling, turning, threading, flywheel grinding, small engine boring, honing, cylinder head resurfacing, manifold resurfacing, driveshaft building/repair, powder coating, media blasting, custom metal fabrication, welding (MIG/TIG/gas), CNC machining, metal prototyping, design/enginee