UPDATE companies SET description='RAM Fabrication is headquartered in Sterling, Virginia, with a corporate office in Ashburn and additional facilities across North Carolina, Georgia, Florida, and South Carolina. The company emerged from the merger of three established sheet metal businesses: Royce Company, founded in 1982 by the Johnson family in the Carolinas, and Advanced Sheet Metal and HVAC Supply, founded in 2006 by the Padiotis family in the Washington metro area, along with MTI Manufacturing. Today, the combined entity is led by second-generation owners Peter Padiotis (President), Ted Padiotis (Vice President), and Len Johnson (Vice President), each with deep roots in HVAC and roofing fabrication.

RAM Fabrication produces HVAC products and fittings for wholesale distributors and architectural roofing products for contractors. The company offers both a standard product line and custom sheet metal fabrication, leveraging state-of-the-art machinery across its multi-site operations. Its capabilities span ductwork, fittings, curbs, and related metal components for commercial and residential construction.

The company serves wholesale distributors and mechanical contractors throughout the mid-Atlantic and southeastern United States. With locations in Raleigh, Sterling, Alexandria, Augusta, Orlando, and Fredericksburg, RAM Fabrication positions itself for rapid delivery across the region.

RAM Fabrication emphasizes its second-generation leadership, citing over 100 years of combined management experience as a differentiator. The company highlights quick turnaround times, a highly knowledgeable staff, and a commitment to cutting-edge technology and innovative product development. Its stated mission centers on customer-first service, employee growth, and maintaining quality standards in the HVAC and architectural metal roofing markets.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet metal fabrication", "Custom fabrication", "HVAC product manufacturing", "Architectural roofing product manufacturing", "Standard product line manufacturing"], "industries": ["Wholesale distribution", "HVAC", "Architectural roofing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Second-generation ownership with over 100 years of combined management experience", "State-of-the-art sheet metal fabrication machinery", "Quick turnaround on high-quality products", "Highly knowledgeable staff", "Strategic multi-location presence across the mid-Atlantic and Southeast"], "facts_used": ["Royce Company founded in 1982 by Johnson family -> /about-us", "Advanced Sheet Metal and HVAC Supply founded in 2006 by Padiotis Family -> /about-us", "RAM Fabrication formed from merger of Royce Company, Advanced Sheet Metal, and MTI Manufacturing -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Sterling, VA -> /about-us and db", "Manufactures HVAC products & fittings and architectural roofing products -> /", "Operates locations in Raleigh, Sterling, Alexandria, Augusta, Orlando, Fredericksburg -> /", "Second-generation ownership with over 100 years combined management experience -> /about-us", "State-of-the-art sheet metal fabrication machinery -> /about-us", "Quick turnaround on high-quality products -> /about-us", "Highly knowledgeable staff -> /about-us", "Family-owned heritage (Johnson and Padiotis families) -> /about-us", "Serves wholesale d