UPDATE companies SET description='Ryobi Die Casting (USA), Inc. operates a die casting campus in Shelbyville, Indiana. The facility is part of the Ryobi Group, headquartered in Japan, which runs 11 manufacturing plants across six countries. The U.S. subsidiary employs more than 700 people at its Shelbyville location.

The company specializes in the development and manufacturing of complex aluminum castings for structural automotive applications. Its capabilities span the full engineering cycle, including R&D, die design, product design support, and process engineering, all performed in-house.

Ryobi serves the global automotive industry, supplying major OEMs such as Honda and General Motors. In 2022, Honda recognized the company with its Excellence in Delivery and Quality award, and General Motors has named Ryobi a Supplier of the Year for five consecutive years.

