UPDATE companies SET description='RDS Wire & Cable, Inc. was founded in 1985 in Gardena, California, where it continues to operate as a stocking distributor of electronic and electrical wire, cable, tubing, and sleeving.

The company maintains a broad inventory of UL AWM appliance wiring materials, MIL-spec military and aerospace wires (including MIL-C-27500, SAE AS22759, and MIL-W-16878 series), coaxial cables, heat-shrinkable tubing, braided sleeving, and fiberglass insulation. Value-added processing services include etching of fluoropolymer (Teflon) wire and tubing, hot marking of heat-shrink tubing, cutting, stripping, striping, tinning, high-speed twisting, and custom cable assembly per customer drawings.

Primary customers are military and aerospace contractors, as well as commercial equipment manufacturers requiring compliant wire and insulation solutions. The firm supplies products built to specifications such as MIL-C-17 coaxial cable, SAE AS23053 heat-shrink tubing, and UL styles 1007, 1015, 1571, and 1180.

RDS differentiates itself with low minimum-order quantities, fast order fulfillment, and an experienced sales staff supported by a quality management system certified to ISO 9001 and AS9100 since 2003. The company also offers RoHS, REACH, and conflict-minerals compliance documentation for regulated programs.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Etching of fluoropolymer (Teflon) wire, cable, and tubing", "Hot marking of heat shrinkable tubing", "Cutting and stripping of wire", "Striping of wire and cable (spiral striping)", "High speed wire twisting", "Custom cable assembly", "Cutting of tubing", "Tinning of wire", "Printing on wire and tubing"], "industries": ["Military", "Aerospace", "Commercial equipment manufacturing", "Industrial"], "materials": ["PVC", "PTFE (Teflon)", "PVDF (Kynar)", "Polyolefin", "Fiberglass", "Nylon", "Copper (bare, tinned, silver-plated, nickel-plated)", "Steel", "Polyimide", "FEP"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Fast order fulfillment; short lead times for custom cables", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Low minimum order requirements", "Fast order fulfillment", "Extensive processing and packaging capabilities (etching, hot marking, cutting, stripping, striping, twisting)", "ISO 9001 and AS9100 certified quality system since 2003", "Custom cables manufactured to customer drawings with short lead times"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1985 in Gardena, CA -> /", "Stocking distributor of wire, cable, tubing, sleeving -> /", "ISO 9001 and AS9100 certified since 2003 -> /", "Low minimum order requirements and fast fulfillment -> /", "Processing: etching, hot marking, cutting, stripping, striping, twisting, custom cables -> /", "Products: UL AWM styles, MIL-C-27500, SAE AS22759, MIL-W-16878, heat shrink tubing, braided sleeving -> /", "Industries: Military/Aerospace and Commercial equipment manufacturers -> /", "RoHS-REACH and Conflict Minerals compliance -> /", "Address: 225 East Garden