UPDATE companies SET description='Radix Wire & Cable is headquartered in Glenwillow, Ohio, and was founded in 1944. The company began as a specialist in high-temperature wire and cable designed for severe environments, and has remained focused on that niche for eight decades.

Radix designs and manufactures a broad range of high-temperature wire and cable products rated from 125°C to 1010°C. The company also produces fire-rated cables certified to UL 2196/ULC S-139, high-voltage cables, data communication cables (CAT6), flare stack ignition cables, and tray cables.

