UPDATE companies SET description='Renovation Manufacturing is a U.S.-based cut-and-sew apparel manufacturer headquartered in Houston, Texas. The company was founded with a mission to support fashion brands at every stage of growth, though the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The company provides full-service cut-and-sew production, covering fashion design consulting, fabric and trim sourcing, pattern making and grading, sample development and prototyping, garment cutting and marking, industrial sewing and assembly, finishing, pressing, and packaging. Its facility is designed for scalable capacity, described as supporting unlimited production volume, allowing brands to move from prototype to large-scale runs without changing partners.

Renovation Manufacturing serves emerging fashion startups launching first collections, growing brands scaling production, and established brands seeking dependable U.S. manufacturing.

The company emphasizes U.S.-based manufacturing for greater quality control, faster communication, and a more responsive supply chain. Its stated differentiators include full-service cut-and-sew capabilities, scalable capacity for growing brands, an experienced industrial production team, and a quality-driven, timeline-focused execution model. The mission centers on empowering fashion brands through dependable, high-quality manufacturing and building long-term partnerships that support sustainable growth and job creation in U.S. garment production.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fashion design consulting", "Fabric and trim sourcing", "Pattern making and grading", "Sample development and prototyping", "Garment cutting and marking", "Industrial sewing and assembly", "Finishing, pressing, and packaging", "Bulk and large-scale production"], "industries": ["Apparel", "Fashion", "Activewear", "Sportswear", "Knits", "Wovens"], "materials": ["Knits", "Woven fabrics", "Activewear fabrics", "Sportswear fabrics", "Trims"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to large-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["U.S.-based manufacturing for greater quality control and faster communication", "Full-service cut-and-sew production from design to fulfillment", "Scalable capacity for growing brands", "Experienced industrial production team", "Quality-driven, timeline-focused execution"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Houston, Texas -> db", "Business type: U.S. cut-and-sew manufacturer -> /", "Services: fashion design consulting, fabric & trim sourcing, pattern making, sample development, cutting & marking, sewing production, finishing & packaging -> /, /about-us", "Industries served: emerging fashion startups, growing brands, established brands; apparel categories: knits, wovens, activewear, sportswear -> /about-us", "Scalable capacity: unlimited production capacity -> /about-us", "Mission: empower fashion brands through dependa